//! The programs and the files they read, compiled into the library.
//!
//! One line a file: the name a program asks for it by, and the file
//! itself, which stays the upstream file in `core/models/markov` and is
//! brought in whole (`include_bytes!`). The alternative was a build
//! script that walks the folder, which is code run at every build to
//! save a list that changes when a newer copy is taken from upstream and
//! at no other time. So the list is written out here, and a test
//! (`the_list_of_bundled_files_is_the_folder`) fails, naming the file,
//! if the two disagree.
//!
//! The files are MarkovJunior's, by Maxim Gumin, under the MIT licence
//! beside them: see `core/models/markov/README.md`.

